# The built tool: `README.md` has the one-line clang invocation that makes it, and a committed
# arm64 Mach-O would be a binary in a Swift repo that no other machine can run.
/sslgen

# Bytecode from running the scripts. The repository's own .gitignore covers this too; it is here so
# the directory stands on its own if it is ever copied out.
__pycache__/
